DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Du bist wieder da!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Und wie ich
sehe, hast du auch jemanden
mitgebracht. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Wie schön.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, prima, da bist du ja. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich
wusste einfach, dass ich mich
auf dich verlassen kann.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Whew!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} When you didn't come back,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I thought something bad might have
happened.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Ufff, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}menos mal!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Me estaba
empezando a preocupar por
si te había pasado algo.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh finalmente!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Pensavo fosse
successo qualcosa di grave,
dato che non ti vedevo tornare.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Huiuiui! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Als du so lange nicht
gekommen bist, dachte ich schon,
es wäre etwas passiert...{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Il paraît que tu voulais me voir
immédiatement ?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Qu'est-ce qui
se passe ?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Sorry for the rush.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} I just wanted to
give back what I borrowed from you
as soon as possible.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Disculpa las prisas, {{TAG:0003:0025:}}pero es que
quería devolverte esto lo antes
posible, ¿sabes?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Pardon, je ne voulais pas te
bousculer.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Je voulais juste te rendre
ça, tu me l'as prêté récemment.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Scusami per averti fatto venire qui
in fretta e furia.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mi sembrava giusto restituirti
quello che mi avevi prestato.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Tut mir leid, dass ich dich wegen so
einer Kleinigkeit störe,{{TAG:0003:0001:}} aber ich
wollte dir das hier zurückgeben.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Böyle acele ettirdiğim için kusura bakma.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Senden ödünç aldığımı mümkün olduğunca
çabuk geri vermek istedim.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh, en effet !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mais tu n'étais pas
obligée si tu en avais encore besoin.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Merci beaucoup, en tout cas !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Vay,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} doğru ya!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bunu sana ben ödünç
vermiştim.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Gerçi daha uzun tutabilirdin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
öyle de olurdu.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ne kadar düşüncelisin!

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ich habe dich gerufen, weil ich dir
etwas geben wollte, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich dachte, es gefällt dir bestimmt!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sahilde yürürken düşürdüğünü sandığım
bir şey buldum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bulduğumda hâlâ terden nemliydi.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Kimin olduğunu öyle tahmin ettim.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}My best {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh man,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I was worried sick about
losing this.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I looked everywhere.
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Next time I lose my old gym socks,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I know where to go for help!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}En iyi {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} eşyam!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Off,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bunu kaybettim diye ödüm kopmuştu.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Her yere baktım.
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Bir dahaki eski spor çoraplarımı kaybedersem,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
yardım için kime geleceğimi biliyorum!

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Did you like those rehydrating
gummies I sent you the other day?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I added in some vitamin C too.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Quería preguntarte si te gustaron
las golosinas isotónicas con
vitamina C que te envié el otro día.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Au fait, tu as reçu les bonbons
protéinés que je t'ai envoyés ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ils étaient bourrés de vitamines !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Aa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Geçen gün gönderdiğim enerji
jelibonlarını beğendin mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}İçlerine biraz C vitamini de kattım.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh yeah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} They were totally tasty!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}I hope you have more.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I finished the
first two dozen yesterday.

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Ah, sí!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Estaban riquísimas!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¿No tendrás más por ahí?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Me
zampé las dos últimas docenas ayer.

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Excuse-moi de t'avoir fait venir en
urgence, mais je me prépare pour
le prochain insectosafari...
... et j'aurais besoin de conseils.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Tu crois que tu pourrais m'aider,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}} ?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Seni buraya kadar çağırdığım için kusura bakma!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Böcek avlama tekniğimi çalışıyorum ve
birkaç ipucuna ihtiyacım var.
Bana yardım eder misin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Du willst ein Insekt fangen?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Ich bin Insektenfang-Champ!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Also,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} erst schleichst du dich an.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du musst tierisch leise sein.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Und halte deinen Kescher bereit!
Wenn du nur noch einen Meter von
ihnen weg bist,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001F:}} schreist du sie an
und wedelst wild mit dem Kescher!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Böcek yakalamak mı?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}} Ben bu işte
harikayım.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Önce,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sessizce yaklaşacaksın.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ağını hazır tutup,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} usul usul ilerle.
Yaklaşık bir metre kalınca da,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:001F:}}
çığlık atıp ağı sallayarak üstlerine koş!

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0003:}}Oye,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} gracias por venir a buscarme.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Acuérdate de pedirle a {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
que te dé algo por el favorcillo.
{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Yo tengo que pirarme.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} He arreglado
un par de pinchazos de unos balones
y tengo que hincharlos.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}} ¡Chao!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Beni çağırdığın için sağ ol.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
başka bir şeye ihtiyacın olursa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} her zamanki
yerde lunge yapıyor olurum.
